## Mask Work and Topography Rights

The Author reserves all rights available under semiconductor topography and
mask work protection regimes (including, without limitation, the Republic of
China Integrated Circuit Layout Protection Act, the United States
Semiconductor Chip Protection Act, and the EU topographies directive) in any
layout or topography derived from the Hardware Design. No right under those
regimes is granted except through a Tape-Out authorization under
Restrictions, Section 3.

