## Interpretation

Ambiguous terms shall be interpreted in favor of maximum freedom for users
while preserving the core principles of this License. Where it is unclear
whether Section 1 or Section 2 of the Restrictions applies, the Strict
Binding test decides, and doubt about binding itself is resolved toward
Section 1 (software).

